    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Why this beats plain vector RAG",
      "items": [
        "Anchors start the walk even if the question embeds poorly",
        "BECAUSE and DECIDED edges pull in the Decisions and Facts behind a hit",
        "Scope gate sits in every Cypher query: no leak via a path",
        "Fallbacks: analysis timeout, reranker error degrade, never stall"
      ]
